{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12144","headline":"过温逸人旧居 · 钱起","name":"过温逸人旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"返真难合道，怀旧仍无吊。\n浮俗渐浇淳，斯人谁继妙。\n声容在心耳，宁觉阻言笑。\n玄堂闭几春，拱木齐云峤。\n鹤传居士舞，猨得苏门啸。\n酹酒片阳微，空山想埋照。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}